{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_106_title", "source_sha256": "b5500b87296522bd6cc83fb0b0ae11a2d6fbe97bb573e5e172f4e170bc2960a1", "ja": "日替わり定食、大盛りで！", "zh": "每日特餐，饭要大份的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_106_synopsis", "source_sha256": "e9601f1ae522f817f6760735cdfc03319c1b7d255269ab8f147639438f43f0bd", "ja": "進路の話で友達と気まずくなり、レッスンに\n集中できない美奈子。更に弟とも喧嘩をして\nしまい、自分はお節介なのかもと落ち込むが\nプロデューサーや仲間に励まされ、自分の\nためにワガママになる事を決める。", "zh": "美奈子因为升学去向的话题和朋友闹得不愉快，\n导致无法集中精力参加练习。后来她又和弟弟吵了架，\n陷入了怀疑自己是不是太爱多管闲事的低落情绪中，\n但在制作人和同伴们的鼓励下，她决定\n要为了自己而任性一回。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_106_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6bae257c2c5f5d8aae3bc82a758046512513baaf7691f3604cc22c8fac86efeb", "ja": "（美奈子の新曲披露のステージは、\n大歓声で幕を下ろした……やったな、美奈子！）", "zh": "（美奈子新歌首演的舞台在一片欢呼声中落下帷幕……干得漂亮，美奈子！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_106_1001_019min", "source_sha256": "28b52cbcbed92f2f15958dc0400fa645ccc69a1bc68c1e15776f6558cdf0e58b", "ja": "今日は本当に、ありがとうございました！\nみなさん、楽しんでいただけましたか？", "zh": "今天真的非常感谢大家！\n各位，玩得开心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_106_1002_audience", "source_sha256": "a3e7f806f1d053c61dc1dd1c37a9ab0cf8e5c5820190ce153d822bc76d9f1010", "ja": "ワァーッ！", "zh": "哇——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_106_1003_019min", "source_sha256": "caf4d30acb51fa6abb9a5bc283b52ced0004914e5c368ff6041f1ed87b7e5599", "ja": "ありがとうございます！　私、これからもっともっと、\nワガママになっちゃおうかなって思ってます！", "zh": "谢谢大家！我想着今后啊，\n干脆变得更加更加任性一点好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_106_1004_019min", "source_sha256": "5b6011df03412ca5ee96acd818336ca6b4049bfd88945951ca78b016f24ae6db", "ja": "その代わり、みんなのこと、お腹いっぱい\n満足させますから……ついてきてくれますかー！", "zh": "作为交换，我会让大家都吃得饱饱的、满足满满……愿意跟上我吗——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_106_1005_audience", "source_sha256": "87e4e7dd9b6f77e55d3ddd30e0920fa5a9cd4cc57412f435848a0b73428b77cf", "ja": "ワアアアアァァァーーーッ！！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊——！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_106_1006_019min", "source_sha256": "8d7cb2cab840f504e425b370c781a6fabf6859aacff68cd3e1be070984e81810", "ja": "わっほーい！\nありがとうございましたーっ！", "zh": "哇——呼！\n谢谢大家——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_106_1008_019min", "source_sha256": "6d5e0b3743dc6684080a9189339e7a272767d3e2b9e62082eae3f5c206db9d16", "ja": "みんな、今日はお疲れ様！　お水用意してあるから、\nしっかり水分補給しておいてね！　それから……。", "zh": "大家，今天辛苦啦！准备好水了，\n记得好好补充水分哦！还有……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_106_1009_050jul", "source_sha256": "f74ee1a22a02b3fea1452f976cabdf0d02ee75632796021b0915fab58c969ad8", "ja": "はは、すっかりいつもの美奈子だな！\n公演のあとくらい、ゆっくりすればいいのに。", "zh": "哈哈，完全就是平时的美奈子嘛！\n演出结束后，偶尔也该好好休息一下呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_106_1010_022ser", "source_sha256": "837c846a520d4da6eaf046fb4e36085300fd8993383a7674e2770561ec938c4d", "ja": "美奈子さん、ワガママになるって言ってましたよね。\n普段とあまり変わらないような……？", "zh": "美奈子小姐，你之前不是说要变得任性一点吗？感觉和往常也没什么区别……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_106_1011_019min", "source_sha256": "b6e94a5b9ba997787a3b54eaa9cbda661bbc0a166e89a7a063ce5ace54645718", "ja": "あ、えへへ……。私はやっぱり、\n誰かのお世話をしてるほうが落ち着くみたい♪", "zh": "啊，嘿嘿……我果然还是照顾别人时更安心呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_106_1012_040tam", "source_sha256": "fa44411716f8549fe023ccfce5b54c6e751274bc0cb5b81f202c050f7d2b6599", "ja": "そっか～。でもみなこ、お世話してばっかりだし……\n今度はたまきも、みなこのお世話してあげる！", "zh": "这样啊～不过美奈子总是在照顾别人……\n这次也让环来照顾美奈子吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_106_1013_019min", "source_sha256": "ad611f322ea8384087fbbb7969b561c0a972e081a3aeaf90d5e1371d691fd1b2", "ja": "ありがとう、環ちゃん！\nたまには、そういうのもいいのかな……？", "zh": "谢谢你，环！\n偶尔这样……好像也不错呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_106_1014_044miz", "source_sha256": "095cc718d6610156837a71a7ce1625cf1cfc977953818ad9b14ab78ff196073d", "ja": "佐竹さんが元気になって、本当によかったです。\n……私も、お世話したい。", "zh": "佐竹小姐恢复精神了，真是太好了。\n……我也想照顾她。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_106_1015_p", "source_sha256": "b37b824db748704c94c81363da4df139c78c25387773cb6ed9ea50d26b9fd08a", "ja": "みんな、お疲れ様！　話の途中に\n申し訳ないんだけど、美奈子にお客さんだ。", "zh": "大家辛苦了！抱歉打断你们的谈话，美奈子，有客人找你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_106_1016_019min", "source_sha256": "3a1409c25c75caf2a2954eac29bdbaf968363b8006e14f54235f7a1fa0589a0c", "ja": "お客さん？\n……わかりました、すぐに向かいますね！", "zh": "客人？\n……好的，我马上过去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_106_1018_kotarou", "source_sha256": "edd80e27667dd554e9fa9792aa160b99c18fc345eb9a3dd350166ac3ff13f4fe", "ja": "あ、お姉ちゃん！", "zh": "啊，姐姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_106_1019_019min", "source_sha256": "618992a797e87bf7f8364f23efb21824976aa707656f54f0eafbef88db38a8e9", "ja": "琥太朗……お母さんも！　来てたの？", "zh": "琥太朗……妈妈也来了！你们来了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_106_1020_minakohaha", "source_sha256": "67839ea9395390c696c04055526cf02ed414eb4e87097b938d3c49f343cf8514", "ja": "ごめんね、美奈子。琥太朗が、どうしても\nいま、美奈子に言いたいことがあるんだって。", "zh": "对不起，美奈子。琥太朗说，他现在无论如何都想跟你说件事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_106_1021_kotarou", "source_sha256": "03538b8db0d270a3173f8ba3d495b237b7d1857798f2a03d4c4c25572893b48a", "ja": "……お姉ちゃん。\nこの前は、ひどいこと言ってごめんなさい。", "zh": "……姐姐。\n上次说了过分的话，对不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_106_1022_kotarou", "source_sha256": "3398496c22d8be1f6092ea75705fda795c2374f54e5a46d14f0b4181850b491a", "ja": "ぼく、ずっとあやまりたくて……。", "zh": "我一直想向你道歉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_106_1023_kotarou", "source_sha256": "6bc17f35054c21d2e32c2b3f13b720dcee3cb66d5f72c12d0749a59880252c46", "ja": "それと……ごはんを食べないなんて言って、\nごめんなさい。", "zh": "还有……说了不吃饭那种话，\n对不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_106_1024_019min", "source_sha256": "4cd97c997be8bc26bafe638c5b6e1d252ad8bc2d2af417b53d430412dfef5cb0", "ja": "大丈夫だよ琥太朗。\nお姉ちゃん、気にしてないから。", "zh": "没事的，琥太朗。\n姐姐没有放在心上啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_106_1025_019min", "source_sha256": "1cb483fb8cb217302583f52deb13ed1ef4ee54bd3d3dd879640b1c18fa29974e", "ja": "それより、お姉ちゃんのほうこそごめんね。\nちゃんと話を聞いてあげられなくて。", "zh": "比起这个，姐姐才该说对不起。\n都没能好好听你说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_106_1026_019min", "source_sha256": "94e0392d3bbfbc00971ff4f02e865d48bcce2cb07aaf30ee5a9a47c34fd91fe4", "ja": "お姉ちゃん、心配だったんだ。また昔みたいにって……\nでもそうだよね。琥太朗は元気になったんだもんね。", "zh": "姐姐，我其实一直很担心。担心会不会又变回以前那样……\n不过，也对。琥太朗已经恢复精神了嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_106_1027_kotarou", "source_sha256": "008b86bfdca45003c45615efe302489f5807e435eb3351345258d0924ab4b42c", "ja": "うん。ぼく、もう元気だよ！", "zh": "嗯。我已经没事了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_106_1028_kotarou", "source_sha256": "5e1b0a12a53c24263057bc4918dfca259bd0725ff615ede9b83f4920445a5607", "ja": "お父さんに言われたんだ。病気でやせてたときも、\n元気で太ってる今も、琥太朗は琥太朗だろって。", "zh": "爸爸对我说过，不管是因病瘦下来的时候，还是现在身体健康、长胖了，琥太朗就是琥太朗，对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_106_1029_kotarou", "source_sha256": "54d5ab5a67e83ed3e99fd3695f316f11e6051724da2be35b635de79b6581e716", "ja": "そんな意地悪を言うやつは、友達じゃないって。\n……だから、大丈夫。", "zh": "会说这种刻薄话的家伙，才不是朋友呢。  \n……所以，没事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_106_1030_019min", "source_sha256": "8801bbea7ac7d4e6fa74cc28c2621823da8609bd7d7616345411c87156259071", "ja": "そっか。……お父さんもお母さんもお姉ちゃんも、\n琥太朗の味方だから。それだけは忘れないでね。", "zh": "这样啊。……爸爸、妈妈和姐姐都是琥太朗的伙伴。\n这一点你可千万别忘了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_106_1031_kotarou", "source_sha256": "a8fd86d23e2ad8a21912cf51de4a6ff256c07739ed98f9c7e0cd3ef55152f106", "ja": "うん！", "zh": "嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_106_1032_019min", "source_sha256": "59032ffbde959999fb8587ae73d470ddd597803bcdc401d048e50faf4f703e21", "ja": "{$P$}さん！\nあの……弟のこと、ありがとうございました！", "zh": "{$P$}先生！\n那个……关于我弟弟的事，非常感谢您！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_106_1033_p", "source_sha256": "dbb667bfbf6d77b3ef7dc2e64ce223e9809bc5303fdd94367087fc750f744bf5", "ja": "美奈子の新曲公演だから、招待しただけだよ。\nそれより、弟さんと仲直りできたみたいでよかったな。", "zh": "只是因为这是美奈子新歌的公演，所以才邀请了他。比起这个，看到你们兄弟俩好像和好了，我就放心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_106_1034_019min", "source_sha256": "ca2af6643d1ba6c86f149655f8c4d086bf335f9161331f2e958916a06b525275", "ja": "はいっ！　私、アイドルとして、もっと\nワガママになるって決めましたけど……。", "zh": "是的！我已经决定了，作为偶像，要变得更加任性一些……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_106_1035_019min", "source_sha256": "20f13d17066b38c63ec007774fb6c8da65760a4f1340ae9bfdfd93ae9b1dc66d", "ja": "{$P$}さんにも、\nもっとワガママを言ってもいいですか？", "zh": "我也能对{$P$}先生，\n提出更多任性的要求吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_106_1036_p", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_106_1037_019min", "source_sha256": "f24e3157dcc704fd48b26b60028f7e9d30a646c3195c68ad0dc928e8ac97fe4d", "ja": "お弁当を作らせてほしいとか、身の回りのお世話を\nさせてほしいとか、いろいろあるんですけど……。", "zh": "比如想让我给你做便当，或者照顾你的日常起居之类的，有很多很多事想拜托你……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_106_1038_019min", "source_sha256": "21c3b3724243f05980ef0548ac89a89faa09192a4bfe0b2efe31fc72ad72585e", "ja": "でも一番は！　ずっとずっと、私のことを\nプロデュースしてほしいです！　……えへへ♪", "zh": "但最重要的是！我想让你一直一直制作我！……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_106_1039_p", "source_sha256": "5dee1afe571430557d4a442abde90b4aed6f50b657428d7fa28fa0e54efb069f", "ja": "……ああ、もちろん！\nそのワガママを聞けるのは、俺だけだからな。", "zh": "……啊，当然！\n能满足你这个任性要求的，只有我啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
